  group envelope child
    note right of Beta : the longest nested side note determines a competing extent
    ]--> Beta : right boundary competitor
    Beta -> Gamma : child member
  end
  deactivate Beta
end
== divider consumes the resolved shared envelope ==
Gamma -->[ : left boundary competitor after groups
Alpha -> Gamma : final internal control
@enduml
